{"overview":"در آینده‌ای ویران‌شده و سمی، جامعه‌ای در یک سیلو زیرزمینی غول‌پیکر وجود دارد که صدها طبقه را در اعماق فرو می‌برد. در آنجا، مردان و زنان در جامعه ای پر از مقررات زندگی می کنند که معتقدند برای محافظت از آنها طراحی شده است.","tagline":"","overview_en":"In a ruined and toxic future, thousands live in a giant silo deep underground. After its sheriff breaks a cardinal rule and residents die mysteriously, engineer Juliette starts to uncover shocking secrets and the truth about the silo.","tagline_en":"The key to the future lies in the past.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":10,"y":2023,"poster":"/izeOL2rZbL7jU1rjkAvu3IieqDo.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":10,"y":2024,"poster":"/cAk4LWiaxGJ1Rn9GLamhnr1Zo1F.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":10,"y":2026,"poster":"/3vMDa6G57ngNkoKGpOfJtixQuaB.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":1,"y":2027,"poster":""}],"episodes":31,"crew":["Graham Yost"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"ربکا فرگوسن","role":"Juliette Nichols","photo":"/ra53cM1aNmdH0aFhj8yBqPOj2fb.jpg","en":"Rebecca Ferguson"},{"name":"کامن","role":"Robert Sims","photo":"/eggJAnJxpn8wYraX7ea5svETB54.jpg","en":"Common"},{"name":"چینازا اوچه","role":"Paul Billings","photo":"/5fbbLI9BPiByyIIRYu9pbRQwyUN.jpg","en":"Chinaza Uche"},{"name":"اشلی زوکرمن","role":"Daniel Keene","photo":"/tKT5ybCjMOV4whEQ6jy8ZQnrP7C.jpg","en":"Ashley Zukerman"},{"name":"Shane McRae","role":"Knox","photo":"/dZAaRg5BOYfN9uqFxDIXef96CgN.jpg"},{"name":"Remmie Milner","role":"Shirley Campbell","photo":"/4LDy6vhBZ11kOevBdAGBRM34d3L.jpg"},{"name":"Alexandria Riley","role":"Camille Sims","photo":"/7rEJ2m0ur4uFPG0YzBQpYQB8Crt.jpg"},{"name":"Reed Birney","role":"Henry","photo":"/dfLgNLUt6Xs2MJJTi6B1iWdXjU6.jpg"},{"name":"لورا اینس","role":"Senator Thurman","photo":"/eO6hk2e7rowODSAgAq61mnv62Cv.jpg","en":"Laura Innes"},{"name":"Jessica Brown Findlay","role":"Charlotte Keene","photo":"/5wNnhFn9hixduXa60Nqygl0Sgev.jpg"},{"name":"بیلی پاستویت","